From: MCC45TR <75160848+MCC45TR@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] media: qcom: rebase dormant Cliffs Iris33 and VIDEOCC on Linux 7.3

Rebase the six source-only Iris candidates from 67c9ee7a. Preserve the
existing upstream platforms, use the 7.3 gen2 firmware descriptor, and
adapt the negative VIDEOCC OPP binding condition. Attribution: Qualcomm,
Alexandr Zubtsov, MiCode 5712080a and OnePlus SM7675 1138e00f.

No consumer DT or Iris match is enabled. Firmware memory and split IOMMU
ownership, controller retention and physical acceptance remain open.

